tile pair = one T x T tile of a and one of b, f32
   T    bytes | H100 allocation           blocks/SM | Apple
  16     2048 | static is enough                 76 | fits
  32     8192 | static is enough                 25 | fits
  64    32768 | static is enough                  6 | fits
 128   131072 | dynamic, opt-in                   1 | too large
